    },
    {
      "SourceElementId": "G11-U02-L22-ACTIVITY-011",
      "SourceSection": "22.2: Rational Solving",
      "SourceExcerpt": "How does the denominator influence the solution(s) to \\(\\frac{x^2}{x-1} = \\frac{1}{x-1}\\)?",
